  "operative_text": "SECTION 1 (ORS 166.377): (1) The governing board of a public university listed in ORS 352.002, the Oregon Health and Science University Board of Directors, the governing board of a community college or a district school board as defined in ORS 332.002 may adopt a policy providing that the affirmative defense described in ORS 166.370 (3)(g), concerning persons licensed to carry a concealed handgun under ORS 166.291 and 166.292, does not apply to the possession of firearms on the grounds of the schools controlled by the board.\nSECTION 1 (ORS 166.377): (2)(c) Install metal detectors at all entrances to any building subject to the policy."
